{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1420790/extras/95582f55234a58fd819d7c761e3cf212.poster.avif?t=1756688776\" width=520 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1420790/extras/95582f55234a58fd819d7c761e3cf212.webm?t=1756688776\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1420790/extras/95582f55234a58fd819d7c761e3cf212.mp4?t=1756688776\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Adjust Strategies, Anticipate the Enemy&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>&quot;Card Chase</i>&quot;\u00a0is a fast-paced deck-building game that blends strategy and resource management.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Carefully choose the order in which you acquire each card\u2014different strategies will affect the difficulty of obtaining future cards and your ability to handle immediate crises. Will you plan for the future or prioritize survival in the present? The choice is yours.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1420790/extras/e7b701023d6930cde5db8044aeab4fee.poster.avif?t=1756688776\" width=520 height=286 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1420790/extras/e7b701023d6930cde5db8044aeab4fee.webm?t=1756688776\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1420790/extras/e7b701023d6930cde5db8044aeab4fee.mp4?t=1756688776\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Unrestricted Dismantling, Turn Foes into Allies&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Equip and unequip gear at any time. Smart equipment combinations will enhance your strategies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sometimes, enemies bring unexpected benefits. Eliminating them too soon may not always be wise.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1420790/extras/161a1527639d4e0579fd98f3da2188f3.poster.avif?t=1756688776\" width=520 height=286 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1420790/extras/161a1527639d4e0579fd98f3da2188f3.webm?t=1756688776\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1420790/extras/161a1527639d4e0579fd98f3da2188f3.mp4?t=1756688776\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Mission Rewards, Unpredictable Fate&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Actively complete missions to earn rewards that can turn the tide of battle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Taking calculated risks to defy fate might just be the right move.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1420790/extras/605c096b8fdd60efa14ab800cb155d22.poster.avif?t=1756688776\" width=520 height=286 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1420790/extras/605c096b8fdd60efa14ab800cb155d22.webm?t=1756688776\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1420790/extras/605c096b8fdd60efa14ab800cb155d22.mp4?t=1756688776\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Resource Depletion, Dynamic Card Pool&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When a card\u2019s durability drops to zero, it is permanently removed. Carelessly wasting precious cards is never a smart decision.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The central area randomly refreshes with monsters and resource cards, ensuring each playthrough presents a fresh strategic challenge!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Thank you for your attention and support!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1420790?t=1756688776","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1420790/db3fe2687b3cc141d6c4014213bafd24609d9b7e/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1756688776","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1420790/6eb3a2902cfc9eab761faccf962c5955dc35a0e5/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1756688776","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1420790/6eb3a2902cfc9eab761faccf962c5955dc35a0e5/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1756688776","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1420790/extras/95582f55234a58fd819d7c761e3cf212.poster.avif?t=1756688776\" width=520 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1420790/extras/95582f55234a58fd819d7c761e3cf212.webm?t=1756688776\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1420790/extras/95582f55234a58fd819d7c761e3cf212.mp4?t=1756688776\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Adjust Strategies, Anticipate the Enemy&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>&quot;Card Chase</i>&quot;\u00a0is a fast-paced deck-building game that blends strategy and resource management.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Carefully choose the order in which you acquire each card\u2014different strategies will affect the difficulty of obtaining future cards and your ability to handle immediate crises. Will you plan for the future or prioritize survival in the present? The choice is yours.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1420790/extras/e7b701023d6930cde5db8044aeab4fee.poster.avif?t=1756688776\" width=520 height=286 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1420790/extras/e7b701023d6930cde5db8044aeab4fee.webm?t=1756688776\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1420790/extras/e7b701023d6930cde5db8044aeab4fee.mp4?t=1756688776\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Unrestricted Dismantling, Turn Foes into Allies&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Equip and unequip gear at any time. Smart equipment combinations will enhance your strategies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sometimes, enemies bring unexpected benefits. Eliminating them too soon may not always be wise.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1420790/extras/161a1527639d4e0579fd98f3da2188f3.poster.avif?t=1756688776\" width=520 height=286 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1420790/extras/161a1527639d4e0579fd98f3da2188f3.webm?t=1756688776\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1420790/extras/161a1527639d4e0579fd98f3da2188f3.mp4?t=1756688776\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Mission Rewards, Unpredictable Fate&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Actively complete missions to earn rewards that can turn the tide of battle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Taking calculated risks to defy fate might just be the right move.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1420790/extras/605c096b8fdd60efa14ab800cb155d22.poster.avif?t=1756688776\" width=520 height=286 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1420790/extras/605c096b8fdd60efa14ab800cb155d22.webm?t=1756688776\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1420790/extras/605c096b8fdd60efa14ab800cb155d22.mp4?t=1756688776\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Resource Depletion, Dynamic Card Pool&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When a card\u2019s durability drops to zero, it is permanently removed. Carelessly wasting precious cards is never a smart decision.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The central area randomly refreshes with monsters and resource cards, ensuring each playthrough presents a fresh strategic challenge!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Thank you for your attention and support!</p>","developers":["Pixel Cattle Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1420790/b923e7b47e4101589c27bf11df7d132935356215/header.jpg?t=1756688